lic ALB only); Reliability (N2–N3 HA/DR met, 2 AZs, Auto Scaling, Multi-AZ database); Performance Efficiency (t3.small capacity per req/sec, CloudFront 50% cache hit reduces origin load); Cost Optimization (stayed within budget, right-sized instances, no read replicas or over-provisioning).",
